{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29385","headline":"荆门西下 · 李商隐","name":"荆门西下","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"一夕南风一叶危，荆云回望夏云时。\n人生岂得轻离别，天意何曾忌嶮巇。\n骨肉书题安绝徼，蕙兰蹊径失佳期。\n洞庭湖阔蛟龙恶，却羡杨朱泣路岐。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李商隐","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_29385.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29385","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}